ras/43947781bd0405b323f6b2d6e88c6347.poster.avif?t=1755067458\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/43947781bd0405b323f6b2d6e88c6347.webm?t=1755067458\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2493910/extras/43947781bd0405b323f6b2d6e88c6347.mp4?t=1755067458\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 18 Armaments, each with a variation mechanic</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 enemies and 10 unique bosses</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 6 Maps with their unique challenges </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > More build diversity, summons, <span class=\"bb_strike\">ricochets</span>, <span class=\"bb_strike\">orbitals</span>, and more! </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple layers of meta-progression</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > 30 different Souls</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >30 different Runes </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > UI/SFX/UX Polish  </p></li></ul>",
